{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b5ecdc90de3713fdc8245ca063fab4ab7521246f1b243e5870fc47088b1e9bea",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d8cf749ff2a5ca0bfdfbac5bc9372338dd819a3c3b473e7a99d0e3abc2aa710",
      "text": "各位！今年那个日子也临近了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50d37415cb3621bbede2dd62758ce90c4cd72e4c610b6a8051f214056143a30b",
      "text": "是情人节呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb18a47ac20a1219619bd898caa270746854406572168559985e88d5c3995307",
      "text": "是充满热情的那个日子呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abfabd89e33d2cfb901fca68f2ac844d2e12d858869819bbf3b7a3161b7496d6",
      "text": "正是如此！互相传达彼此热情的\n情人节又再次到来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab9c140e554a2b31d627c36347afa26e606bdda92208a28b2840b580315a7703",
      "text": "去年因为制作人君的努力，\n偶像们全员都在各项工作中取得了成果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfefd4e525e8088cad2615d0ca5fdcf3583d72ef7907134ad1e4127baa061b07",
      "text": "是的。而且从制作人那里收到巧克力的\n偶像们，看起来也都非常开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cc1926b36aac937f3326d9badc9fc58493c89cfb0ba4abbfbe54db54c11ca5a",
      "text": "嗯。去年的情人节，\n可以说是取得了大成功吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6933ca6b2d91595aa30111987016ac141d7aa4c2ed53736ba6bbda11fa242494",
      "text": "所以呢。想必你也已经察觉到了，\n我有件事想拜托●●●●プロデューサー君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a4a314b1d348084c545cf2652356fa5bb234e00ba20628703425d69b00dc4fd",
      "text": "今年也希望你能把巧克力送给他们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad81729a27f1e0a3bda901eaf39c719b34ed51487f415a89dd35acccf610a26",
      "text": "如果能从制作人那里收到巧克力，\n大家一定都会很高兴的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e717907930d38a0d48490ed7ff5c5da04c17bf578a54d9b9e5929f054c59f93",
      "text": "我明白了！今年我也会\n准备倾注了热情的巧克力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_23_5_01_000_23:5_01_000_23:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:453bc90498d9363d7938a1e0e4df6f4b92c130054cd10b9ddb3402f0ff26b82f",
      "text": "嗯，那么就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
